# Scripts to obtain the position of the graphene sheets and their temperatures 


Step 1: Run compute.sheet_temp.slurm (  input - dump files in the scratch folder, 
                                        output - positions and temperatures of graphene sheets for each dump file )

Step 2: Run find_wall_lims.py ( input  - positions of graphene sheets for each dump file from step 1, 
                                output - mean position of the graphene sheets across all dump files )

Using the mean position of the graphene sheets from Step 2, we can create bins and evaluate temperature of water between graphene sheets 
